           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clients must provide this token to modify any playlist (add, remove, or create). Playback controls (play/pause/next/previous) do not require a token. Leave blank to block all playlist changes from remote clients. This token is sent in plain text over your local network - do not reuse a password you use elsewhere!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
